      ],
      "text": "It looks somehow pained as it rages around in search of light, which serves as its energy. It’s apparently from another world."
    },
    {
      "versions": [
        "ultra-moon"
      ],
      "text": "Light is the source of its energy. If it isn’t devouring light, impurities build up in it and on it, and Necrozma darkens and stops moving."
    },
    {
      "versions": [
        "sword"
      ],
      "text": "It survives by absorbing light. After a long time spent slumbering underground, impurities accumulated within it, causing its body to darken."
